Resolved that the trust shall purchase one animal ambulance (light commercial vehicle with ambulance body) from Godavari Auto Bodies, Nashik, at a cost not exceeding ₹6,40,000, and that the secretary, Ms. Swati Deshpande, is authorised to sign the purchase documents.

Godavari Auto Bodies, Ambad MIDC, Nashik
