To: Karuna Paws Rescue Trust. Light commercial vehicle chassis ₹4,35,000; ambulance body with stretcher, cage and loading ramp ₹1,48,000; oxygen cylinder kit and lighting ₹22,000; registration and insurance ₹35,000. Total: ₹6,40,000. Quotation valid for 60 days.

